-- Quest markers without any point: 1,554 quests (about 1,360 from Legion, over 900 world quests) had
-- `quest_poi` rows without `quest_poi_points`, hence no area on the map. Filled from TrinityCore's
-- TDB 735.00 (build 24330), whose points match ours wherever both exist (154,095 of 154,449).
--
-- 1. 899 quests covered by the TDB: their empty rows are replaced by the TDB ones.
-- 2. 48 objectives left without a marker by 2026_09_24_01: the TDB area is added under a new Idx1,
--    without touching the rest of the quest.
-- The objective index comes from the 7.3.5 row of the same objective when there is one, otherwise from
-- the objective's StorageIndex (both agree 98% of the time in the 7.3.5 data); the TDB, like our old
-- rows, often uses 0 everywhere. The ~650 remaining quests (mostly 7.3, Argus) are not in the TDB.
-- Re-runnable.

